# Public client identifiers for the production build of Collector Shop.
#
# None of these are secrets. Firebase web config identifies the project; it
# does not grant access — Firestore/Storage rules and Auth do that. The exact
# same config is already committed in apps/portfolio/src/lib/firebase.js and
# apps/email/.env.production for this same josh-cocciardi project.
#
# Committed so the production build is reproducible from any Claude Code web
# session with no local setup. For local dev, copy .env.example to .env.local.
